This package binds two projects together and implements neither of them.

  rgb-lib            https://github.com/RGB-Tools/rgb-lib
                     The RGB protocol implementation. MIT.

  rgb-lib-wasm       https://github.com/UTEXO-Protocol/rgb-lib-wasm
                     The WebAssembly bindings that make rgb-lib usable in a browser,
                     maintained by UTEXO and published as @utexo/rgb-lib-wasm. MIT.

  WDK                https://github.com/tetherto/wdk
                     The wallet framework whose interfaces this module implements,
                     by Tether. Apache-2.0.

Both rgb-lib and its WebAssembly bindings are declared as dependencies and are neither
vendored nor modified here. Their licences travel with their own packages.
